          </a>
        </div>
        <span class="bridge__link" aria-hidden="true">
          &rarr;
        </span>
        <div class="bridge__col">
          <p class="bridge__year">Today</p>
          <p class="bridge__col-label">Our Leadership</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Marica T. Harris, 26th International Grand Basileus</li>
            <li>
              An elected International Board of Directors and five regional leadership structures
            </li>
            <li>Priorities: scholarship, service, sisterhood, and principled leadership</li>
          </ul>
